what GitHub records that Git doesn't.

231
00:17:03,091 --> 00:17:07,884
You can now take a repository that somebody
left in the middle of something, and

232
00:17:07,924 --> 00:17:11,145
name the operation from its
files before you touch it.

233
00:17:11,185 --> 00:17:16,159
Practise that in the lab, files first. Until
then, look at the state first and type

234
00:17:16,199 --> 00:17:18,092
second. See you in the next one.
